  "passives": [
    {
      "name": "True Flame of Incineration",
      "description": "When the Traveler has over 20 Nightsoul points, the attack AoE of the Blazing and Scorching Thresholds from the Elemental Skill Flowfire Blade after they hit opponents is increased."
    },
    {
      "name": "Embers Unspent",
      "description": "After the current active character inside a Blazing Threshold or Scorching Threshold triggers a Pyro-related reaction, the Traveler will regain 5 Energy. This can occur once every 12s. Additionally, when a nearby party member triggers a Nightsoul Burst, the Traveler will regain 4 Energy."
    },
    {
      "name": "Foreign Starfire",
      "description": "Draw new strength from journeys past. For every element you have resonated with, you gain additional {LINK#N10050001}buffs{/LINK}.\n\nAdditionally, when nearby party members trigger Nightsoul Burst, Traveler will receive 1 stack of Blade of the Sacred Flame, max 2 stacks. After obtaining 2 stacks of Blade of the Sacred Flame, performing a Charged Attack will consume all stacks of Blade of the Sacred Flame and transform into a special Charged Attack: Inferno.\n\nCharged Attack: Inferno\n· Each Charged Attack hit deals increased, Nightsoul-aligned Pyro DMG. Increase in DMG is equal to 200% of Traveler's ATK.\n· Charged Attack: Inferno can be triggered up to once every 15s."
    }
  ],
